Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Final Resolution
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 38
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My wings…they seem better than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they really were treating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, save that flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only ones who successfully gathered the trial materials this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t see that coming, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who might have gotten in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,was taken care of by the accidents I staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.59,0:02:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can get the fragment without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible? I had already…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this match is a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got some skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, the Flower Baby trial begins tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your final preparations today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That means there’s still a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to help Lan Baobao find a Spark—impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really bad luck, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn’t run into some unexpected trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,our Flower Babies would have successfully obtained a Spark too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unexpected trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You encountered that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In all these years, it was the first time so many things came crashing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it really just an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We encountered it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you experienced it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Xi Huahua—he can even dodge accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn’t just save himself; he saved me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s certainly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao has become so outstanding, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven’t seen an outstanding flower since Nuan Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let the Elder hear that, or he’ll be heartbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuan Huahua?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you know about Nuan Huahua?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t mean to tell me {\i1}you{\i0} don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the Elder carefully cultivated a flower just as outstanding as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That flower actually violated the Flower Tribe’s rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,associating with the silt and eventually joining the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.75,0:04:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move; this healing mud will cure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched the silt flats for a long time but couldn’t find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.79,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Nuan was worried that the bugs had taken you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was she who led the Silt Tribe people to find you, risking everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I treated you all with such disdain, yet you still saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s simply because you didn’t understand us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:04:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you are the flower who, back then, defied the Flower Tribe’s rules
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and joined the Silt Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am the traitor you speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.15,0:05:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you defy the Flower Tribe’s rules back then
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and end up joining the Silt Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t a matter of breaking rules or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We all live under the same tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the Flower Tribe considered good, while the Silt Tribe is seen as bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they just eat, drink, and play in the mud all day, neglecting any real work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s what I thought too, until…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,one day, while I was out tending to the flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally fell into the Silt Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Arriving there for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the place filthy and chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to fly back up to the tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but discovered my wing was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s when the Silt Tribe appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The way they treated me…It was far beyond anything I had imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually helped treat my wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They treated me very kindly during my stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave me withered-leaf mushroom soup to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They took me for a mud bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I found this place fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And they certainly aren’t lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day, they use silt to protect the roots of the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To them, the mud is just like pollen is to us—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,wonderful and full of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But as the Flower Babies only wanted to evolve into the Flower Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and not into the Silt Tribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the number of Silt Tribe members was dwindling year by year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If things went on like this, the Silt Tribe would inevitably lose their last remaining habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was worried that the Xilan Tree would be affected as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I decided to become one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate and drank with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and wielded the power of the silt alongside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They made me realize
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that protecting the Xilan Tree should be our shared responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was truly happy during that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, I told the Elder about my experiences here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We had been misunderstanding the Silt Tribe all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all born to weed and till the soil for the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.34,0:07:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you met the Silt Tribe once,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to question the rules established by generations of Flower Tribe Elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the Flower Tribe Elders were wrong from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the former Elders possibly be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No flower has ever spoken like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not worthy of being a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mentor, for all your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of stubborn, obstinate flowers—it’s infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s put the past behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that our Xilan Tree continues to grow strong and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this really an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going out for a moment; I’ll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just can’t stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go check on Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.73,0:08:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined I could also evolve into a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.05,0:08:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to prepare a grand gift to properly thank Mentor Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure my plan goes off without a hitch, you have to meet with an accident today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re the culprit behind these accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of ability is this? This certainly isn’t the power of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for a group of people who might interfere with our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Be especially wary of this guy; he can wield strange powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.47,0:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…I’ll settle the score with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn, I’m out of energy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who…exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you all going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The bugs have been getting more and more rampant lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, they’ll devour all our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I want to go to the Bug Nest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and get our food back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better head back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But don’t mention that you met the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you’ll end up just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But those bugs look really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll just have to bite the bullet and face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.69,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, those bugs are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stay here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help out, too. If I can’t even fight off these bugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,how am I supposed to save my world?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful and stay in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,that at our core, we are all striving for the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That bug is formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.99,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll just have to bite the bullet and face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who…who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the wings that represent you are a member of the Flower Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.59,0:11:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the most outstanding flower possibly choose me—the worst Flower Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it was all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What perseverance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I—didn’t—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way I could become a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar! I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I never want to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.69,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
